.* QEZBCKUP: the backup displays (DSPBCKUP for the daily, weekly and
.* monthly options), the GO SAVE and GO RESTORE command defaults, and
.* the list of commands an option is about to run; DSPBCKSTS, the last
.* backup of each item, and its history (F22).
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
