:DATAI VAR=FLALLD USAGE=OUTPUT.All
:DATAIX VAR=FLALLT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=FLALLCD USAGE=OUTPUT.All (changes only)
:DATAIX VAR=FLALLCT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=FLLISTD USAGE=OUTPUT.From list
:DATAIX VAR=FLLISTT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.User directories
:DATAI VAR=UDALLD USAGE=OUTPUT.All
:DATAIX VAR=UDALLT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=UDALLCD USAGE=OUTPUT.All (changes only)
:DATAIX VAR=UDALLCT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:EDATAGRP.
