:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPBCKHST HELP=HLPHST KEYL=HSTKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=DATETIME BOTSEP=NONE.Display Backup History
:TOPINST.Type options below, then press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=HIST SCROLL=YES.(No backup has run.)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105'.5=Display backup details
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Option
:LISTCOL VAR=HDATE USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=13.Backup Date
:LISTCOL VAR=HOPT USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=26.Backup Options
:LISTCOL VAR=HSET USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=47.Tape Set
:LISTCOL VAR=HCHG USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=56.Changes Only
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPBCKDTL HELP=HLPHST KEYL=PRMKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=DATETIME.Display Backup Details
:DATA DEPTH=7.
:DATAI VAR=HDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Backup date
:DATAI VAR=HTIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Backup time
:DATAI VAR=HOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.Backup option
:DATAI VAR=HDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:DATAI VAR=HSET USAGE=OUTPUT.Tape set
:DATAI VAR=HSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=STEPS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL VAR=HSTEP USAGE=OUTPUT.Saves
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
